retrieval.indexRecommended:
Many Skills are currently installed. You can build a Skill graph index to enhance how installed Skills are used.

The Skill graph index provides the following enhancements:

- Maintains a hierarchical classification of Skills;
- Explores structural dependencies between Skills, including inputs, outputs, and prerequisites;
- Provides stronger runtime progressive discovery, retrieval, and orchestration for Skills.*

*Building or refreshing the Skill graph index calls a model to analyze installed Skills and therefore consumes additional tokens.
